      </Alert>
      <h2 id="before-you-rename-or-move-anything" class="group scroll-mt-20">Before you rename or move anything<a href="#before-you-rename-or-move-anything" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p>Ask what depends on it first:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"dogsbay-xml where-used topics/installing-audacity.dita --root ."} lang="bash" />
      <p>The report covers references from maps, conrefs, links, and images. Add <code>--map</code> to include references that reach the file indirectly through a key:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"dogsbay-xml where-used topics/installing-audacity.dita \\\n  --root . --map audacity-guide.ditamap"} lang="bash" />
